1
00:00:00,881 --> 00:00:01,851
(gasps)

2
00:00:01,849 --> 00:00:03,419
This place is great!

3
00:00:03,417 --> 00:00:05,987
(Leonard:)So nice of that doctor
to just let you use it.

4
00:00:05,986 --> 00:00:08,416
(Penny:)Well, she is taking me
to an Indigo Girls concert,

5
00:00:08,422 --> 00:00:10,152
(Penny:)so hold that thought.

6
00:00:12,126 --> 00:00:13,326
(Penny:)Okay.

7
00:00:13,327 --> 00:00:14,827
(Sheldon:)Well,

8
00:00:14,829 --> 00:00:16,959
should we check
each other for ticks?

9
00:00:19,333 --> 00:00:23,003
(Amy:)Sheldon, all we did
was walk in from the car.

10
00:00:23,003 --> 00:00:24,633
(Howard:)Oh. Well,
suit yourself.

11
00:00:24,638 --> 00:00:26,838
(Sheldon:)Who wants to check me?

12
00:00:29,710 --> 00:00:32,010
(Amy:)On the other hand, safety first.

13
00:00:38,614 --> 00:00:40,484
(rain falling loudly)

14
00:00:40,483 --> 00:00:42,153
(Amy:)Wow, it's really
coming down.

15
00:00:42,151 --> 00:00:43,621
(Penny:)This sucks.

16
00:00:43,619 --> 00:00:44,919
(Leonard:)And there goes our hike.

17
00:00:44,920 --> 00:00:47,720
Oh, not our hike!

18
00:00:47,723 --> 00:00:49,123
(Sheldon:)Now we have

19
00:00:49,125 --> 00:00:51,555
(Sheldon:)to stay safe and warm.

20
00:00:51,560 --> 00:00:53,130
(Penny:)You know, we could still go.

21
00:00:53,129 --> 00:00:54,559
(Penny:)A little rain
isn't gonna kill us.

22
00:00:54,563 --> 00:00:56,293
(Leonard:)Have you been outside
in the rain with Sheldon?

